            "type": "text",
            "text": "About this pattern"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A layered red rose built from a small sphere bud, five inner spiral cone petals, and seven wider outer cone petals. The petals curl naturally when worked in DK yarn and are sewn around the bud in two rings."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Centre bud"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Rounds: 7. Start with a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring-rose"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "magic ring"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and increase to a small sphere, stuffing before "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "stuffing-and-closing-rose"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "closing"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 1: 6 sc in magic ring"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 2: [inc] × 6 (12 st)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 3: [2 sc, inc] × 6 (18 st)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 4: [3 sc, inc] × 6 (24 st)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 5: [2 sc, dec] × 6 (18 st)"
