                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "Working in the round"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " keeps every piece seam-free and helps the petals curl evenly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Estimated yarn: bud 2 g, each inner petal 2 g, each outer petal 2 g, stem 2 g."
